  "comment": "Android Partitions Explained: boot, system, recovery, data, cache &amp; misc Here is a list of internal partitions in Android: /boot /cache /data /misc /recovery /system And here are the external partitions: /sdcard + (sdcard2 is some cases) /sd-ext So, there are total of 8 partitions, 6 of which are internal while 2 are external. Of all these 8, only 1 partition. sdcard, is found on all devices",
